hat for every scheme <MATH_0008> and\nmorphism <MATH_0009>,\ngiven by an object <MATH_0010> of the fibre category of <MATH_0011> over <MATH_0012>,\nthe object <MATH_0013> is in fact in the fibre category of <MATH_0014> over <MATH_0015>.\nNamely, the fibre product <MATH_0016> is an algebraic\nspace and <MATH_0017> is a surjective smooth morphism.\nHence there is an fppf covering <MATH_0018> such that\n<MATH_0019> factors through <MATH_0020> for all <MATH_0021>.\nThen <MATH_0022> factors through <MATH_0023>\nand hence through <MATH_0024>. Thus <MATH_0025> is an object of\n<MATH_0026> (as <MATH_0027> is the fibre product of <MATH_0028> with\n<MATH_0029> over <MATH_0030>).\nSince <MATH_0031> is a strictly full substack, we conclude\nthat <MATH_0032> is an object of <MATH_0033> as desired.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b874dce8d1ff8c2673865ea057662eae2326cf87028ed3d0ca21925437344715", "unit_id": "inventory:stacks-properties:0507:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:60179aa645522a358cf6099b542e37e2af2a9211146bff21a38f1466a5ba815a", "hash": "sha256:60179aa645522a358cf6099b542e37e2af2a9211146bff21a38f1466a5ba815a", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 65998, "byte_start": 65392, "file": "stacks-properties.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:428b4cb32ba26426c779e377effa03460eaa5a9b351e9cd468c17c8a891b33ec", "line_end": 1822, "line_start": 1808}, "owner_tag": "0507", "parent_tag": "04YK", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "stacks-properties", "math_text_regions": [{"delimiter_kind": "display-dollar", "pieces": [{"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0001"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0002"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0002"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0003"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0003"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0004"}, {"kind": "text